<section class="section" id="licence">
  <div class="container licence-grid">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Licence</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Generator and dataset licences</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="licence-cards">
      <article class="card licence-card">
        <h3 class="h3">Generator: Apache-2.0</h3>
        <p class="body-text">
          The CLI, adapters, schemas, and Implementation Guide sources are Apache-2.0.
        </p>
        <p class="body-text">
          Note that we strictly separate the code from the actual medication catalog data. We don't
          relicense medication catalog; those come with their respective providers' open licence terms.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card licence-card">
        <h3 class="h3">Datasets: upstream terms</h3>
        <p class="body-text">
          All catalog data is licensed according to the respective providers' licensing terms. We aim
          to include only data that carries a licence permissive enough for commercial and
          non-commercial use. Some licences may require attribution.
        </p>
        <p class="body-text">
          We are not liable for fitness for a specific purpose, legal compatibility with or
          suitability for integration into any product.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="body-text">
      <a class="inline-link" href="/licence">Licence notes</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .licence-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .licence-grid .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .licence-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .licence-card {
    padding: 1.35rem 1.3rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 720px) {
    .licence-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
